# ───────────────── large binaries pending Git LFS ─────────────────
# .gitattributes already routes *.pth/*.task/*.pdf through LFS. This first
# commit was made in an environment without git-lfs installed, so these are
# excluded here rather than committed as plain (huge) blobs.
# On a machine WITH git-lfs installed, add them properly:
#   git lfs install
#   git add -f archive/legacy-2d-unet/checkpoints/best_model.pth \
#              packages/backend/models/hand_landmarker.task \
#              "docs/NerveGear Doc.pdf"
#   git commit -m "Add large binaries via Git LFS"
archive/legacy-2d-unet/checkpoints/*.pth
packages/backend/models/*.task
docs/*.pdf

# ───────────────── OS / editor ─────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
